  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nSteps to reproduce:\r\n1. [navigate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate) (step 12) sets navigable's [is delaying load events](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#delaying-load-events-mode) to true.\r\n2. [navigate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate) (step 20.2) aborts subsequent steps and [finalize a cross-document navigation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#finalize-a-cross-document-navigation) that is supposed to reset [is delaying load events](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/document-sequences.html#delaying-load-events-mode) never reached.\r\n",
